@title Damaged project opens as a recovered copy
@area Fixtures
# A project file cut short (a full disk, a bad copy). It is never edited in place: the readable part
# is written to a recovered copy beside it, the copy opens, and a warning says what happened.
open qa/fixtures/damaged-cut-short.novo
wait 30
expect "damaged"
expect "recovered copy"
expect "was not changed"
shot recovered-copy
check_layout
check_blank recovered-copy
